  WrittenDialogue: "Oh my god I was so stupid.\nI knew I should’ve just shot myself in the head.\nAll overdosing did was give me permanent nerve damage and make me a quadriplegic.\nNow I’ll never know happiness.\nAll the nurses come in and make fun of me, calling me Kermit the frog.\nAnd one of my cousins said I was a real life Betty Spaghetti.\nAt least you came to visit me in the hospital.\nCould you play that line clearing game I showed you? I’d play it myself but my hands don’t work anymore."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
